  "text": "Bandits waylay travelers and plunder their valuables before disappearing back to their wilderness hideouts. Many bandits seek only to steal and release their victims alive, though a few prefer to leave no witnesses.\n\n---\nIn the underbelly of society, the lawless reign supreme."
